{"version":1,"content":"<p>吃大閘蟹，大家首先想到清蒸和中式蟹粉菜式，但其實除了中菜，本地的西餐廳和日本料理都以大閘蟹入饌，打造出與別不同的鮮味，再加上店內有其他的新菜式配搭，為食客帶來驚喜。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;日式巧製&lt;br/&gt;銅</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:01.958920+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:00:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820262+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820262+00:00","content_hash":"157382412e7b95ec5c90e1ceb89374d6415c81bec6dd6c87d7cb0590eb1656ad","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}